  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">직관적으로 대류를 확인할수 있습니다<br><br>과학실에 짱박혀 있는 잉크, 사각 수조, 스포이드, 양초 종이컵 등을 사용했습니다. 어느과학실에나 기본적으로 있을법한 재료입니다.<br>혹시 몰라서 제가 사용한 잉크 사진 첨부합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv346whwfj2dxcne6yhh3972n@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1632\" data-video-height=\"1074\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rv346whwfj2dxcne6yhh3972n/thumbs/4.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33257140054&amp;signature=mN0yKpZ8TWkiOFAOXlknvAEZdtQ%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"1632\" data-video-origin-height=\"1074\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv346whwfj2dxcne6yhh3972n?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2MzQ2d2h3ZmoyZHhjbmU2eWhoMzk3Mm4iLCJ0aWQiOiJkMjAzYmMyNy0wOTg5LTQxYzAtYjE1Zi0xM2FkZGE4MTYxZmQiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODMyMTl9.-6ffvzyjAn-SRVj1IzEELR0FaCowOXGokEHhbs3ETi6XjscNhU0h0vac0fK-GnWD6Es_ZvIajxrmeua7BtV98g&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"1632\" height=\"1074\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvp4qx9a2gavypblvwku93sy7@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1280\" data-video-height=\"720\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvp4qx9a2gavypblvwku93sy7/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33257377972&amp;signature=lXqmVEbnPlgukhbjcsuqKzSirYg%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"1280\" data-video-origin-height=\"720\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvp4qx9a2gavypblvwku93sy7?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2cDRxeDlhMmdhdnlwYmx2d2t1OTNzeTciLCJ0aWQiOiJkZWZmODY0NS1iZWE5LTQ2NDEtYjgwMS0yZmNhMzQzNDVhMmMiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODMyMTl9.9qVfUeFwUsaKqOPJH6wDS-G1G79aIkyRBeyTdaTB2-ou7WKZuBlN5gKhHTNecczC6qajoTia4M4no4dRVlHjew&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">(중요)잉크 수조에 섞이지 않게 주입하는 팁!!<br>1.수조에 물을 넣고 2~3분 정도 물의 요동이 없을때까지 기다림( 잉크를 잘 주입해도 물이 요동하고 있으면 섞여버림)<br>2.일회용 스포이드의 마지막 눈금만큼만(너무 많이 넣지 마세요!!) 잉크를 주입함<br>3.잠잠해진 수조에 스포이드를 넣기전에 스포이드 입구에 잉크가 맺힐정도로 최대한 공기를 뺀 상태로천천히 수소바닥까지 감<br>4.수조바닥근처에서 아주 천천히 스포이드에서 잉크를 방출함<br>5.방출을 끝낸 상태 누름 그대로 스포이드를 수조밖으로 빼냄 <br><br>그런다음 수조를 종이컵위에 조심히 올리고 불붙힌 양초가 든 컵을 잉크 밑에 가져가서 관찰!!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c1a0757a26bc5cdd1f24ad6e67d26f1117327c38\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c1a0757a26bc5cdd1f24ad6e67d26f1117327c38\" data-origin-width=\"493\" data-origin-height=\"690\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/92f21776881ce97975dcdb1478a3ebf7d8889029\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/92f21776881ce97975dcdb1478a3ebf7d8889029\" data-origin-width=\"1048\" data-origin-height=\"1303\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
